        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "P06-S07-U02",
      "role": "counselor",
      "text": "你坐在她旁边看她的那两个晚上，身体好像同时被拉回小时候怕黑的地方，又得绷着一根弦，怕她回头问“你是谁”。这两种感觉在那一会儿是怎么交替的？",
      "request_sha256": "0c00c3889ce523739bb9c0ad0ae6fb413874fc1089154f6dc3078a85da140f75",
      "usage": {
        "input_tokens": 8086,
        "input_tokens_details": {
          "cached_tokens": 0
        },
        "output_tokens": 412,
        "output_tokens_details": {
          "reasoning_tokens": 368
        },
        "total_tokens": 8498,
        "x_details": [
          {
            "input_tokens": 8086,
            "output_tokens": 412,
            "output_tokens_details": {
              "reasoning_tokens": 368
            },
            "prompt_tokens_details": {
              "cached_tokens": 0
            },
            "total_tokens": 8498,
            "x_billing_type": "response_api"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "P06-S07-U03",
      "role": "client",
      "text": "其实吧，那种感觉就像坐在地上的人是我，可又被拎到天花板上往下看，两个我都没法真正挨着谁。我守到后半夜，她忽然又不翻了，自己回床上躺着，我却更睡不着了，总觉得她安静下来比翻东西还让人发毛。",
      "request_sha256": "d050c61bffa4d11f9cd631903ea4eaa8ec28eb1d39737ef7181af2de9ec8bf98",
      "usage": {
        "input_tokens": 9014,
        "input_tokens_details": {
          "cached_tokens": 7168
        },
        "output_tokens": 443,
        "output_tokens_details": {
          "reasoning_tokens": 380
        },
        "total_tokens": 9457,
        "x_details": [
          {
            "input_tokens": 9014,
            "output_tokens": 443,
            "output_tokens_details": {
              "reasoning_tokens": 380
            },
            "prompt_tokens_details": {
              "cached_tokens": 7168
            },
            "total_tokens": 9457,
            "x_billing_type": "response_api"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "P06-S07-U04",
      "role": "counselor",
      "text": "你被拎到天花板上往下看的感觉，好像那一刻你必须从自己身体里分出去一点，才能继续守着她；可这样你也更难真正挨着谁。她安静下来你反而更睡不着，也许因为翻东西时你还能把注意力都放在她身上，而她一静下来，你就得面对那个悬着的、落不下来的自己。",
      "request_sha256": "c158d088f74f0e1ece4f906d7f5032a1dd80b0f65cf7a79de6c7128c15421593",
      "usage": {
        "input_tokens": 8238,
        "input_tokens_details": {
          "cached_tokens": 7168
        },
        "output_tokens": 292,
        "output_tokens_details": {
          "reasoning_tokens": 217
        },
        "total_tokens": 8530,
        "x_details": [
          {
            "input_tokens": 8238,
            "output_tokens": 292,
            "output_tokens_details": {
